 Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor consists of a patterned shielding layer and an integrated inductor.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"The patterned shielding layer is designed to provide effective electromagnetic shielding, while the integrated inductor enables the component to function as an inductive element.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"This integrated design allows for a reduction in the overall size and complexity of electronic devices, making it an attractive solution for modern electronics.\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"**Significance**\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"The Patterned Shielding Structure and Integrated Inductor has been involved in a significant legal filing, as evidenced by US patent 11387315.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"This patent filing demonstrates the importance of this innovation in the field of electronics and highlights its potential to revolutionize the design of electronic devices.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"**Evidence**\"}, {\"id\": \"s13\", \"text\": \"* US Patent 11387315: \\\"Patterned shielding structure and integrated inductor\\\" [1]\"}, {\"id\": \"s14\", \"text\": \"* Patent filing documents, available through the United States Patent and Trademark Office (USPTO) [2]\"}, {\"id\": \"s15\", \"text\": \"**References**\"}, {\"id\": \"s16\", \"text\": \"[1] United States Patent and Trademark Office.\"}, {\"id\": \"s17\", \"text\": \"(2022).\"}, {\"id\": \"s18\", \"text\": \"Patent No.\"}, {\"id\": \"s19\", \"text\": \"11387315: Patterned shielding structure and integrated inductor.\"}, {\"id\": \"s20\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/patents.uspto.gov\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s21\", \"text\": \"[2] United States Patent and Trademark Office.\"}, {\"id\": \"s22\", \"text\": \"(n.d.).\"}, {\"id\": \"s23\", \"text\": \"Patent Filing Documents.\"}, {\"id\": \"s24\", \"text\": \"Retrieved from <https:\\\\/\\\\/patents.uspto.gov\\\\/>\"}, {\"id\": \"s25\", \"text\": \"This Wikipedia ent